.el .ds Aq '
.TH ckman-openpgp-access-set-touch-cache 1  ckman 
.SH NAME
ckman\-openpgp\-access\-set\-touch\-cache \- Set the card\-wide touch cache duration in seconds (0 disables caching)
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBckman\-openpgp\-access\-set\-touch\-cache\fR [\fB\-a\fR|\fB\-\-admin\-pin\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fISECONDS\fR> 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Set the card\-wide touch cache duration in seconds (0 disables caching)
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-a\fR, \fB\-\-admin\-pin\fR \fI<ADMIN_PIN>\fR
Admin PIN (prompted when omitted)
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
<\fISECONDS\fR>
Cache duration in seconds
